  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nDecoding the information: \n\n \n \n\n **Symbol**\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n **Meaning**\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nRequired resultant: 421\n\nSo,​​ checking options one by one\n\nOption 1) 22 B 6 C 190 A 2 D 22\n\n⇒22 × 6 + __**190 ÷ 2**__ - 22\n\n⇒__**22 × 6**__ + 95 - 22\n\n⇒__**132 + 95**__ - 22\n\n⇒__227 -____ 22__ = 205\n\nOption 2) 22 A 6 D 190 B 2 C 22 \n\n⇒__**22 ÷ 6**__ - 190 × 2 + 22\n\n⇒3.67 - __**190 × 2**__ + 22\n\n⇒**__3.67 + 22__** - 380\n\n⇒__25.67 - 380__ = -354.33\n\nOption 3) 22 B 6 D 190 A 2 C 22 \n\n⇒22 × 6 - __**190 ÷**____** 2**__ + 22\n\n⇒__**22 × 6**__ - 95 + 22\n\n⇒__**132 **____**+ 22**__ - 95\n\n⇒__154 - 95__ = **59**\n\nOption 4) 22 B 6 D 190 C 2 A 22\n\n⇒22 × 6 - 190 + __**2 ÷ 22**__\n\n⇒__**22 × 6**__ - 190 + 0.09\n\n⇒__132 + 0.09__ - 190 \n\n⇒__132.09 - 190__ = -55.91\n\nThus, out of all options, only option - 3 has a resultant of '59'.\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.\n\n61",
